{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/915206-help-with-five-new-style-merits-two-fighting-styles-and-three-driving-styles","id":915206,"title":"Help with five new style merits- two fighting styles and three driving styles","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-15T17:25:59-07:00","id":915206,"title":"Help with five new style merits- two fighting styles and three driving styles","content":"So, these were originally for inclusion in my Mage: The Transgression project, but all of them aren't exclusive to it so I figure I can work a bit on them here. They cover character concepts more likely to come up there, but they aren't Enlightened exclusive. <br /> <br /> First, is there a Telekinetic Combat fighting style? I vaguely remember hearing that Hurt Locker had that, but I could be wrong. If not, that's something I'd like to develop. Second fighting style is Powered Armor Operation- I'd like to have the mechanics be such that it could work for anything from traditional hardsuits to enchanted armor to magical rune tattoos. <br /> <br /> The Driving Styles are Dogfighting, Bridge Command, and Walker Piloting, respectively focusing on high-speed aircraft and spacecraft, large craft that require a bridge of crew, and mecha. Again, I want them to be as versatile as possible- Dogfighting could apply to a fighter jet, an X-Wing, or even a riding dragon, while Bridge Command could work for the captain of a space cruiser or a man-o-war, and Walker Piloting could even work if your character rides a golem around.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T20:00:32-07:00","id":915315,"title":"","content":"There is indeed a previewed Telekinetic Combat style, as well as a number of loosely related merits<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jM_bpQHo-dM4yop592S09y4AjQGLLTNhK5_0-5_85kg/edit\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jM_bpQHo-dM4yop592S09y4AjQGLLTNhK5_0-5_85kg/edit\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jM_bpQHo-dM4yop592S09y4AjQGLLTNhK5_0-5_85kg/edit\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jM_bpQHo-dM4yop592S09y4AjQGLLTNhK5_0-5_85kg/edit </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> There's also this thread, which includes some cool supplemental powers<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/842864-advanced-supernatural-merits-and-styled-supernatural-merits\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/842864-advanced-supernatural-merits-and-styled-supernatural-merits\"> Advanced Supernatural Merits ... and Styled Supernatural Merits! - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/842864-advanced-supernatural-merits-and-styled-supernatural-merits\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/842864-advanced-supernatural-merits-and-styled-supernatural-merits </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Because I love you all. NOW WORSHIP ME! Here we go! This is a rough first draft, mind. The general idea has been there for a while but I haven't sat down to write </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T21:03:59-07:00","id":915364,"title":"","content":"Those Hurt Locker merits are awesome. <br /> <br /> Though those &quot;epic&quot; styles might honestly be better served by just rolling a Mage or a Deviant. <br /> <br /> Hmmmm, that PK Style is everything I need, so that leaves the other four.<br /> <br /> I've always wanted to do a ChroD campaign with pirates involved, so Bridge Command would help with that a lot. Here's a rough, rough preliminary idea. <br /> <br /> \u2022 Red Sky At Night: Can ask the GM for information about upcoming weather conditions that would impact the ship's operation. Maybe a bonus to deal with storms?<br /> \u2022 \u2022 All Hands On Deck: Can obviate the unskilled penalty for crew members. <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Captain On Deck: Can provide some sort of bonus to rolls made by crew members. <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Broadside: Can instantly bring the ship within attack range of another ship. <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Down With The Ship: Something that allows a ship to keep operating even when severely damaged, enough to get to safety/evacuate the crew/keep fighting. <br /> <br /> And here are some Powered Armor Operation ideas:<br /> \u2022 Wear The Weight Well: Negates or limits movement penalties due to weight. <br /> \u2022\u2022 Waldo Strike: Can make two attacks per turn if the armor has a secondary weapon of some sort- can punch and fire off an arm cannon in the same turn. <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Peak Performance: Can keep the armor functioning even when it would normally have penalties from damage. <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Master Armorer: One of two effects. Can either repair the armor in difficult conditions or take it on or off very quickly. <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Juggernaut Rampage: Become briefly immune to damage by &quot;overloading&quot; the armor, taking damage when the effect wears off. <br /> <br /> Dogfighting:<br /> \u2022 Punch It!: Can immediately make a vehicle reach its top speed. <br /> \u2022\u2022 Loop: Can attempt to shake a pursuer by looping behind them. <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Expanded Range: Negates or diminishes range penalties <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Keep It Together: When hit with a shot that would disable part of the craft, can spend willpower to avoid incurring a penalty from the damage. <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 One In A Million Shot: Can choose to either deal Aggravated damage or automatically hit a chosen target regardless of size. <br /> <br /> Walker Piloting:<br /> \u2022 Metal Jog: Increases the walker's top and safe speeds. <br /> \u2022\u2022 Better Balance: Makes it almost impossible for the walker to fall or trip. <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Keep It Together: Same as the Dogfighting level. <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Unmatched Agility: Allows the walker to execute maneuvers that would normally be impossible for its size. <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Overclock: Temporarily increase the walker's speed and power by removing safety locks, incurring damage after the effect finishes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5358,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","user":"Geckopirateship","date":". 06-16-2016, 12:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}